      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7737600140885683027, guid: 13c64e802785e4847be9b5d2958a44ee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: NPC Variant
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8424219675579236305, guid: 13c64e802785e4847be9b5d2958a44ee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcDialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8424219675579236305, guid: 13c64e802785e4847be9b5d2958a44ee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'npcDialogueLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'ELDER THEROS: Long ago, Gaia breathed life into the forests and raised
        the mountains with her will. But now, her grove is silent, her spirit bound
        by roots of rot and stone. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8424219675579236305, guid: 13c64e802785e4847be9b5d2958a44ee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'npcDialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: "ELDER THEROS: Erebus has sunk his claws deep into the earth. You must
        awaken her, child. Prove your strength, and tread carefully\u2014what lies
        beneath is not always still. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8424219675579236305, guid: 13c64e802785e4847be9b5d2958a44ee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'npcDialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: "ELDER THEROS: As you step into her sacred ground, Gaia lends you a
        piece of her power\u2014a barrier of stone and bark to shield you in times
        of peril. Press Q to summon it. It will guard you for thirty heartbeats,
        but use it wisely. Even the strongest walls must fall in time. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8424219675579236305, guid: 13c64e802785e4847be9b5d2958a44ee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: playerResponsePrompts.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8424219675579236305, guid: 13c64e802785e4847be9b5d2958a44ee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'playerResponsePrompts.Array.data[0]'
      value: "She must be in pain\u2026 I\u2019ll find her. I\u2019ll bring her back. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8424219675579236305, guid: 13c64e802785e4847be9b5d2958a44ee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'playerResponsePrompts.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Then I\u2019ll be ready for whatever stirs. The earth will remember
        her guardian. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8424219675579236305, guid: 13c64e802785e4847be9b5d2958a44ee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'playerResponsePrompts.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'Her strength... I can feel it already. This shield will be the first
        step toward restoring balance. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8580756411385516203, guid: 13c64e802785e4847be9b5d2958a44ee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
      value: -0.049873002
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8580756411385516203, guid: 13c64e802785e4847be9b5d2958a44ee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.y
      value: -0.48
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8580756411385516203, guid: 13c64e802785e4847be9b5d2958a44ee, type: 3}
